    "id": "royal-chambers-hamlet-context",
    "source": "<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>You murderous, traitorous woman. You owe my father's honor your life.</indent>\n<b>Gertrude:</b> <indent=16%>Please, Hamlet, don't do this!</indent>\n<b>Gertrude:</b> <indent=16%>I love you with all my heart. Please don't let it come to this.",
    "target": "<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>你这杀人害命、背信弃义的女人！你得用命来偿还我父亲的名誉。</indent>\n<b>乔特鲁德:</b> <indent=16%>求你了，哈姆雷特，别这样！</indent>\n<b>乔特鲁德:</b> <indent=16%>我全心全意地爱你。求你，别走到这一步。",
