  {
    "id": "royal-chambers-ophelia-context",
    "source": "<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>Sleep now, Claudius. You're not making any sense.</indent>\n<b>Claudius:</b> <indent=16%>...</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>(He's asleep downstairs, at last.)</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>(Even though I know what he's capable of—what he's done—I still somehow feel terrible for him.)</indent>\n<b>Ophelia:</b> <indent=16%>(I've seldom been in Claudius's chambers, let alone unattended...)",
    "target": "<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>睡吧，克劳狄斯。你说的话都没头没脑的。</indent>\n<b>克劳狄斯:</b> <indent=16%>...</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>（他终于在楼下睡着了。）</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>（虽然我知道他做得出什么——也知道他做过什么——可不知为什么，我还是很同情他。）</indent>\n<b>奥菲莉娅:</b> <indent=16%>（我很少来克劳狄斯的寝宫，更别说像这样无人陪同了……）",
